         measured: S(r)/(r^2/2xi^2) = 0.99993, 0.99933, 0.99336 at r/xi = 1e-4,1e-3,1e-2
         This is f30's verified Green's function (residual 2e-16). The same
         form that removes the 1/r PPN potentials here removes the
         static quadrupole, because both are static-field observables.

